<title>LATVIA: LIEPAJAS FISH H1 LOSS 49,359 LATS.</title>
<headline>LIEPAJAS FISH H1 LOSS 49,359 LATS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The stock exchange said on Monday that Liepaja fish cannery had a first-half net loss of 49,359 lats on turnover of 729,458 lats.</p>
<p>The stock exchange said in a statement that the company's gross profit was 23,775 lats but that it had sales expenses of 16,553 lats and administrative expenses of 44,181 lats.</p>
<p>Its loss before taxes and extraordinary items was 6,041 lats and it had extraordinary expenses of 41,993 lats.</p>
<p>The company had assets of 884,654 lats and short-term debts of 853,703 lats.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
